We are proud to announce that. after more than two years of not releasing updates, we are going to release the Remaster version of Freebie, Source Code DLC and there's also an Android version of Freebie in development.

Remaster version will include:
-Better graphics and smother gameplay;
-Another gamemode called "Color Mode".

Sourcecode DLC will include:
-A full Sourcecode to PC/Steam version of the game, remastered. Editable using Game Maker Studio 2.

Freebie for Mobile:
-It's going to be sligthly different than how it works on PC;
-It's going to be more aesthetic;
-It's going to actually be free;
-It's going to be published under a different Studio name;

After the release of Freebie Remaster Version for PC, we are going to support the game with bug fixes, but we will only focus on mobile version when it comes to content and other stuff.

